<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 148 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 148 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to May 7 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to April 30:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 58,628	58,775</p>
<p> Money market intervention    16,295	17,070</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,904	 1,904</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,917	 2,047</p>
<p> Other				 6,791	 6,849</p>
<p> Total assets		     85,535	86,645</p>
<p>In the previous week, to April 30, reserves fell by 2.55 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
